From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:20:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: apple: isp: start the IMX958 temporal filter
 as macOS does

macOS starts the temporal noise filter of the J604's IMX958 camera (M4
MacBook Pro 14", T8132) with the words 1, 1 and turns its high strength
on, every session; the driver sends 1, 0 and high strength off. Read
from the ISP's command channel while macOS streamed the camera in Photo
Booth. The band 0 modulation (off) and its thresholds (120 and 100 in
1/256 steps) already match.

Send macOS's values where macos_session_settings applies (T8132, on by
default); macos_session_settings=N gives back 1, 0 and high strength
off.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c | 7 +++++--
 drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.c | 3 ++-
 drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.h | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c
index f1a2d67423..0cd370e019 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c
@@ -1232,6 +1232,9 @@ static int isp_ch_configure_power_line(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 ch)
 static int isp_ch_configure_temporal_filter(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 ch)
 {
 	struct isp_format *fmt = isp_get_format(isp, ch);
+	/* macOS starts this camera's filter with 1, 1 and high strength on */
+	bool macos = READ_ONCE(macos_session_settings) &&
+		     isp->hw->macos_session_settings;
 	int err;
 
 	switch (isp_setfiles[fmt->id].temporal_filter) {
@@ -1248,11 +1251,11 @@ static int isp_ch_configure_temporal_filter(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 ch)
 		return isp_cmd_apple_ch_temporal_filter_stop(isp, ch);
 
 	case ISP_TEMPORAL_FILTER_BAND0:
-		err = isp_cmd_apple_ch_tnr_start_h17(isp, ch);
+		err = isp_cmd_apple_ch_tnr_start_h17(isp, ch, macos);
 		if (err)
 			return err;
 
-		err = isp_cmd_apple_ch_tnr_high_strength_set(isp, ch, 0);
+		err = isp_cmd_apple_ch_tnr_high_strength_set(isp, ch, macos);
 		if (err)
 			return err;
 
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.c b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.c
index a7b2382f36..b3305985d9 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.c
@@ -650,12 +650,13 @@ int isp_cmd_apple_ch_temporal_filter_disable(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 chan)
 	return CISP_SEND_IN(isp, args);
 }
 
-int isp_cmd_apple_ch_tnr_start_h17(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 chan)
+int isp_cmd_apple_ch_tnr_start_h17(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 chan, u32 unk_10)
 {
 	struct cmd_apple_ch_temporal_filter_start_h17 args = {
 		.opcode = CISP_OPCODE(CISP_CMD_APPLE_CH_TEMPORAL_FILTER_START),
 		.chan = chan,
 		.unk_c = 1,
+		.unk_10 = unk_10,
 	};
 	return CISP_SEND_IN(isp, args);
 }
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.h b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.h
index 0d4a6c87e3..e304e57461 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.h
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.h
@@ -734,7 +734,7 @@ int isp_cmd_apple_ch_motion_history_start(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 chan);
 int isp_cmd_apple_ch_motion_history_stop(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 chan);
 int isp_cmd_apple_ch_temporal_filter_enable(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 chan);
 int isp_cmd_apple_ch_temporal_filter_disable(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 chan);
-int isp_cmd_apple_ch_tnr_start_h17(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 chan);
+int isp_cmd_apple_ch_tnr_start_h17(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 chan, u32 unk_10);
 int isp_cmd_apple_ch_tnr_high_strength_set(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 chan,
 					   u32 enable);
 int isp_cmd_apple_ch_tnr_band0_mod_set(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 chan,
-- 
2.43.0

